          "framing": "The transition diagrams below record observed source facts: string literals assigned to a field, and the comparisons of that same field that appear earlier in the same function. They are not a proof of reachability, and a value never assigned in source will not appear."
        },
        {
          "id": "state.caching",
          "number": "4.4",
          "title": "Caching Tier",
          "concern": "A dedicated cache separate from the primary datastore.",
